      template-exec-error markers ("executing"/"no such template"/"incomplete
      or empty"): 0;  <html> present: 1;  </body> present: 1;
      occurrences of "file-list" on the Explorer page: 0.
    Server log contains no template errors for the whole session.

(g) THE DELETION OF {{define "file-list"}} (explorer.html, -47 lines) IS SAFE.
    I proved nothing else referenced it, at HEAD, before the deletion:
      $ git grep -n "file-list" HEAD -- ':!coverage.html'
      the ONLY consumers were the define itself (explorer.html:739) and the
