(h) THE REGRESSION TEST EXISTS AND RENDERS THE SWAP PARTIAL, not the page.
    internal/handlers/explorer/handlers_test.go:1478-1600,
    TestSwapPartials_RenderSortableFileList, subtests toggle/upload/delete.
    Each calls the handler directly (handleFileToggle / handleFileUpload /
    handleFileDelete) into an httptest.ResponseRecorder and asserts on
    rec.Body: data-sort-btn="name"|"rows"|"mindate"|"enabled", scope="col",
    and data-name=/data-size=/data-rows=/data-mindate=/data-enabled=, plus a
    negative assertion that ">Delete<" (the legacy partial's row action) is
