    initial          name:-  rows:-  mindate:-  enabled:-
    after name asc   name:ascending, others "-"
    after name desc  name:descending, others "-"
    after rows/mindate/enabled clicks the previous column's aria-sort is cleared
  The ▲/▼ glyph is decorative and carries aria-hidden="true" on all four
  arrow spans (verified in the DOM and 4x in the raw toggle response body);
  the accessible names stay "File" / "Rows" / "Date Range" / "On".

A-2 Both themes — PASS. Toggling the `dark` class on <html>:
