=== CONCLUSION ===

PASS. Every numbered requirement is met, and the attempt-1 failure mode is
closed by evidence rather than inference: the three swap handlers demonstrably
render the same `filemanager-file-list` template as the initial page, their
real HTTP response bodies carry 4 data-sort-btn buttons, 5 scope="col" headers
and full per-row data-* attributes, a genuinely replaced table (tableIsSameNode
= false) kept its sort order and aria-sort across a live htmx swap, and a Go
test now asserts all of that against the swap endpoints' response bodies.
